@layout "layout.nview"

@section "content"

<div class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-title">{{ title }}</h1>
    <p class="page-desc">{{ subjudul }}</p>
    <span class="version-pill">Rikat Declarative / PrimeNG-Style</span>
</div>

<div class="prose">
    <p>Indikator pemuatan deklaratif: bilah progres persentase dan skeleton shimmer placeholder untuk konten yang sedang dimuat.</p>

    <div class="component-card">
    <div class="component-header">
        <span class="component-title">Progress Bar & Skeleton Loader Deklaratif</span>
        <button type="button" class="btn-copy-code"><l-icon name="copy" size="13"></l-icon> <span>Salin</span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="component-canvas component-canvas-stacked">
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem; width: 100%;">
    <div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Progres Unduhan Berkas</div>
        <l-progress value="68" show-value></l-progress>
    </div>
    <div>
        <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Skeleton Shimmer Loader</div>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem;">
            <l-skeleton width="100%" height="18px"></l-skeleton>
            <l-skeleton width="75%" height="18px"></l-skeleton>
            <l-skeleton width="45%" height="18px"></l-skeleton>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
    </div>
    <pre class="component-code-block"><code>&lt;!-- Progress Bar &amp; Skeleton Loader --&gt;
&lt;l-progress value="68" show-value&gt;&lt;/l-progress&gt;

&lt;!-- Skeleton Shimmer Placeholder --&gt;
&lt;l-skeleton width="100%" height="18px"&gt;&lt;/l-skeleton&gt;
&lt;l-skeleton width="75%" height="18px"&gt;&lt;/l-skeleton&gt;
&lt;l-skeleton width="45%" height="18px"&gt;&lt;/l-skeleton&gt;</code></pre>
</div>

    <div class="bottom-nav">
